      "reactions": null,
      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Fully agreed, the account creation date is the only immutable piece of information that can be used to determine that the creator of the account is over 18, especially if you combine it with other metrics like account playtime to determine that the account hasn't just been sitting dormant for years.\n\nSome of the oldest accounts are breaching the 9 year mark which would make the account creator 9 years old back in a time before children were common to see in VRC since that only ramped up with the introduction of the Quest as a platform.\n\nI have no intention of giving my government ID to third parties for verification but I have been around long enough on VRC that there's no way that I could be considered as being under 18, so this is a great alternative to that in my eyes.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
